<title>MEXICO: Mexico crude port Dos Bocas still closed - ministry.</title>
<headline>Mexico crude port Dos Bocas still closed - ministry.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pajaritos, one of Mexico's main crude ports that had been closed to bad weather, reopened Monday while another, Dos Bocas remained shut to outgoing shipping movements, the Communications and Transport Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shipping in the Gulf of Mexico, where both ports are located, was hit over the weekend as a cold front coming from the north whipped up waves of around eight feet (2.4 meters) and winds of 37 mph (60 km/h), the ministry said.</p>
</text>
